  "title": "Formalization of bounds for the triangular Hilbert transform and Carleson's theorem",
  "abstract": "This is a Lean 4 formalization of L^3 bounds for the triangular Hilbert form, following a streamlined version of an OpenAI manuscript. This also gives a proof of Carleson's theorem on pointwise convergence of Fourier series, which is also part of this formalization. Theorem statements are human-written, while the proof was automatically generated by coding agents.",
